e (4 points as both Prevailing and Seat Wind). My best winning chances lie in developing combinations with W1-W4 pairs and T2-T3-T4 sequences, which have much better tile availability (3-4 unshown each). Keeping these tiles maximizes flexibility for forming winning patterns.\n\nAnswer: Play F1"}
