ucture. With only 2 J1 remaining unshown, completing a Dragon Pung is unlikely. The Bamboo tiles (T2, T3, T3, T4) form a strong consecutive structure, and the Character tiles W4-W5 can potentially form chows with W6 (2 unshown). Discarding J1 maintains maximum flexibility for developing All Chows or chow-based patterns while keeping pairs for potential pungs.\n\nAnswer: Play J1"}
